The proposed text aims, in accordance with article 26 of the aforementioned Law, to establish a procedure for advance decisions that combines simplicity, straightforwardness, flexibility and transparency.  
In a start-up phase of the new system, applications will be submitted to a service which will be established for this purpose within the central services of the department at a sufficiently functional hierarchical level.  
In this respect and given the fact that the FPS Finance is currently in a restructuring phase, the competent Authority will ensure that the new advance decisions service is placed at an appropriate level within the administrative structure.  
